(4747643, 685125, 33096, '<td valign="top">Awesome, a classic lightning shot.  You don''t often get to take a picture like this so it''s a mix of luck and skill.  keeping the shutter open for less time and taking more shots may reduce what I suspect is some motion blur on the cloud, but it''s a minor point.</td>', 'Awesome, a classic lightning shot.  You don''t often get to take a picture like this so it''s a mix of luck and skill.  keeping the shutter open for less time and taking more shots may reduce what I suspect is some motion blur on the cloud, but it''s a minor point.', '2008-06-04 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
