(4747658, 683256, 33096, '<td valign="top">A well exectued image of the milkyway. good exposure and tracking.  A bit noisey, did you use a darkframe to subtract?</td>', 'A well exectued image of the milkyway. good exposure and tracking.  A bit noisey, did you use a darkframe to subtract?', '2008-06-04 09:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
