(4747672, 685348, 33096, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, a lovely classic starscape, nice and sharp. Shame you didn''t keep the original colours.</td>', 'Brilliant, a lovely classic starscape, nice and sharp. Shame you didn''t keep the original colours.', '2008-06-04 09:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
