(4747746, 683137, 87808, '<td valign="top">I am not sure why you did the light painting in this shot.  I belive it was to illuminate the wooden structure. To me, it would have been better if you had covered teh light source and softened it, that way the structure would have been bathed in light</td>', 'I am not sure why you did the light painting in this shot.  I belive it was to illuminate the wooden structure. To me, it would have been better if you had covered teh light source and softened it, that way the structure would have been bathed in light', '2008-06-04 09:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
