(4747880, 685348, 32011, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the front cover of a science book I had back in high school.  Excellent image.  Use of the tree to provide a focus and balance to the image is brilliant.</td>', 'This reminds me of the front cover of a science book I had back in high school.  Excellent image.  Use of the tree to provide a focus and balance to the image is brilliant.', '2008-06-04 10:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4747900, 683965, 32011, '<td valign="top">Think I would have preferred a bit longer an exposure to get the stars creating an arc, or a shorter exposure to keep them as points.  As it is they look a bit more like a blur... the flare is good though.  The trees are more an annoyance than a feature... might have tried painting them with a torch to give them some colour and bring some balance to the image.</td>', 'Think I would have preferred a bit longer an exposure to get the stars creating an arc, or a shorter exposure to keep them as points.  As it is they look a bit more like a blur... the flare is good though.  The trees are more an annoyance than a feature... might have tried painting them with a torch to give them some colour and bring some balance to the image.', '2008-06-04 10:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4747908, 683783, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Great title for the image too.  The colours are excellent and the shot is well balanced.  Great job with such a tricky challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Great title for the image too.  The colours are excellent and the shot is well balanced.  Great job with such a tricky challenge.', '2008-06-04 10:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4747927, 685354, 32011, '<td valign="top">Another one that brings back memories of my high school science book.  This one is excellent, in that you''ve managed to capture the earth''s rotational axis in the image.  Colours are beautiful and the trees provide a good grounding/perspective for the image.</td>', 'Another one that brings back memories of my high school science book.  This one is excellent, in that you''ve managed to capture the earth''s rotational axis in the image.  Colours are beautiful and the trees provide a good grounding/perspective for the image.', '2008-06-04 10:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4747937, 684419, 32011, '<td valign="top">Great effort on a difficult challenge.  Would have benefited from something terrestrial to provide some perspective.</td>', 'Great effort on a difficult challenge.  Would have benefited from something terrestrial to provide some perspective.', '2008-06-04 10:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4747955, 684798, 32011, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  The mountains are a good balance to the star trails.  The colours are good.  Image may have benefited from a longer exposure (i.e. longer streaks) and perhaps a bit of an arc to the streaks.</td>', 'Nice photo.  The mountains are a good balance to the star trails.  The colours are good.  Image may have benefited from a longer exposure (i.e. longer streaks) and perhaps a bit of an arc to the streaks.', '2008-06-04 10:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4747966, 685384, 32011, '<td valign="top">Silhouette of a tree line on an over exposed sky... ummm.... it''s a nice silhouette.</td>', 'Silhouette of a tree line on an over exposed sky... ummm.... it''s a nice silhouette.', '2008-06-04 10:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4747971, 685461, 49954, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred cropping out the roof, it''s distracting.</td>', 'Would have preferred cropping out the roof, it''s distracting.', '2008-06-04 10:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748024, 683137, 84124, '<td valign="top">Very creative, great take on the challenge!</td>', 'Very creative, great take on the challenge!', '2008-06-04 10:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748032, 683953, 84124, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  Making the best out of a cloudy sky, your model made this work wonderfully.</td>', 'Fantastic!  Making the best out of a cloudy sky, your model made this work wonderfully.', '2008-06-04 10:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748040, 685459, 84124, '<td valign="top">This should ribbon.  Only defect is excessive noise, but still a dramatic shot.</td>', 'This should ribbon.  Only defect is excessive noise, but still a dramatic shot.', '2008-06-04 10:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748060, 684485, 84124, '<td valign="top">Absolutely delicious!</td>', 'Absolutely delicious!', '2008-06-04 10:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748179, 685125, 66616, '<td valign="top">Thats a fantastic image and i bet some people will down vote it because there are no stars...</td>', 'Thats a fantastic image and i bet some people will down vote it because there are no stars...', '2008-06-04 11:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748185, 683105, 66616, '<td valign="top">great image</td>', 'great image', '2008-06-04 11:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748196, 683603, 66616, '<td valign="top">great work</td>', 'great work', '2008-06-04 11:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748199, 684485, 66616, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2008-06-04 11:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748203, 684742, 66616, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I bet some of the of the comments have been DNMC because there is no moon or stars...</td>', 'Nice image, I bet some of the of the comments have been DNMC because there is no moon or stars...', '2008-06-04 11:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748231, 683783, 55837, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2008-06-04 11:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748271, 685354, 15643, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see this portrait. But it still is great.</td>', 'Would have liked to see this portrait. But it still is great.', '2008-06-04 11:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748278, 685271, 15643, '<td valign="top">...Like a big pizza pie!</td>', '...Like a big pizza pie!', '2008-06-04 11:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748342, 685283, 65547, '<td valign="top">A very good capture, M2 or M5 i think. Like the sharpness and processing. The focus in extremely good! Regards!</td>', 'A very good capture, M2 or M5 i think. Like the sharpness and processing. The focus in extremely good! Regards!', '2008-06-04 12:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748448, 685422, 93765, '<td valign="top">Nice idea! And rather pretty. I like the little "comet" in the upper righthand corner...</td>', 'Nice idea! And rather pretty. I like the little "comet" in the upper righthand corner...', '2008-06-04 12:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748482, 685476, 93765, '<td valign="top">The sky doesn''t offer much drama here, so the silhouettes of the barn and the woods serve a purpose. The light paint takes it from bland to original. It almost gets a "Scary Movie"- like effect. I had a similar idea, before going for Partners instead, so I''ll throw in an extra sympathy point...</td>', 'The sky doesn''t offer much drama here, so the silhouettes of the barn and the woods serve a purpose. The light paint takes it from bland to original. It almost gets a "Scary Movie"- like effect. I had a similar idea, before going for Partners instead, so I''ll throw in an extra sympathy point...', '2008-06-04 12:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748488, 683159, 49109, '<td valign="top">overall too soft, no clear focus. looks like early evening, too</td>', 'overall too soft, no clear focus. looks like early evening, too', '2008-06-04 12:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748509, 684916, 49109, '<td valign="top">as far as i know, rainbows occur only when the sun is shining; not at night.</td>', 'as far as i know, rainbows occur only when the sun is shining; not at night.', '2008-06-04 12:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748531, 685034, 93765, '<td valign="top">Since this was "advanced editing", you could have taken advantage of that and done a few things (assuming, of course, that you have the software for it). At the very least clone out the power line. Possibly taking a second frame with the background sharp, and merge them. Increase the saturation on the foreground, or better still (as I have a feeling you may have used a camera mounted flash) done a light paint from the side. Like this, I find it difficult to see anything interesting, captivating or pretty in it, sorry.</td>', 'Since this was "advanced editing", you could have taken advantage of that and done a few things (assuming, of course, that you have the software for it). At the very least clone out the power line. Possibly taking a second frame with the background sharp, and merge them. Increase the saturation on the foreground, or better still (as I have a feeling you may have used a camera mounted flash) done a light paint from the side. Like this, I find it difficult to see anything interesting, captivating or pretty in it, sorry.', '2008-06-04 12:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748571, 683603, 93765, '<td valign="top">Nice! Blue and grey indeed. The perspective is interesting. I''m not sure your frame works, though. Assuming you have a wide black bar on top as well, that doesn''t hurt, it may in fact add to the vastness, but the bar below is disturbing. A long while I thought it was the shore, and was about to suggest a crop, until I realised that it is far too straight for that.</td>', 'Nice! Blue and grey indeed. The perspective is interesting. I''m not sure your frame works, though. Assuming you have a wide black bar on top as well, that doesn''t hurt, it may in fact add to the vastness, but the bar below is disturbing. A long while I thought it was the shore, and was about to suggest a crop, until I realised that it is far too straight for that.', '2008-06-04 13:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748591, 685459, 93765, '<td valign="top">Cool! Thought I might say something about the crop, but you will have had your reasons for going like this. Anyway, the sky is amazing, and the lasers obviously give the edge.</td>', 'Cool! Thought I might say something about the crop, but you will have had your reasons for going like this. Anyway, the sky is amazing, and the lasers obviously give the edge.', '2008-06-04 13:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748601, 685351, 93765, '<td valign="top">Surreal. The lower third is stunning, the rest I''m not so sure about. The stars look an awful lot like hot pixels to me.</td>', 'Surreal. The lower third is stunning, the rest I''m not so sure about. The stars look an awful lot like hot pixels to me.', '2008-06-04 13:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748624, 685125, 82503, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot. The clouds alone are already very beautiful, but with the lightning in there, it''s perfect! Ribbon.</td>', 'This is a stunning shot. The clouds alone are already very beautiful, but with the lightning in there, it''s perfect! Ribbon.', '2008-06-04 13:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748631, 683603, 82503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The sky itself is not that special, but together with the skyline it works. And DPCers usually like pictures like this one, so it''ll do well.</td>', 'Beautiful! The sky itself is not that special, but together with the skyline it works. And DPCers usually like pictures like this one, so it''ll do well.', '2008-06-04 13:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748639, 685400, 90658, '<td valign="top">Visually interesting, the colors work well together, especially in the reflection.  It just seems slightly oof to my eyes and maybe just a bit "un-Wow-ish.</td>', 'Visually interesting, the colors work well together, especially in the reflection.  It just seems slightly oof to my eyes and maybe just a bit "un-Wow-ish.', '2008-06-04 13:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748642, 685321, 90658, '<td valign="top">The color of the sky is rather nice.  I just don''t feel a "wow" factor.</td>', 'The color of the sky is rather nice.  I just don''t feel a "wow" factor.', '2008-06-04 13:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748646, 684408, 93765, '<td valign="top">I take it, that this is not the kit 18-200 lens, even with a 1,6 teleconverter, right?  Amazing what you can find up there, given a good telescope and knowing where to look. Great shot!</td>', 'I take it, that this is not the kit 18-200 lens, even with a 1,6 teleconverter, right?  Amazing what you can find up there, given a good telescope and knowing where to look. Great shot!', '2008-06-04 13:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748651, 683953, 90658, '<td valign="top">I like the story.  It''s obvious that you had the intent of meeting the challenge, but nature wasn''t going to help you out.</td>', 'I like the story.  It''s obvious that you had the intent of meeting the challenge, but nature wasn''t going to help you out.', '2008-06-04 13:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748654, 684419, 90658, '<td valign="top">This just seems flat to me, not a lot going on.</td>', 'This just seems flat to me, not a lot going on.', '2008-06-04 13:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748657, 685397, 90658, '<td valign="top">Composition is wonderful.  The greens and blues against the black of the sky are fantastic!</td>', 'Composition is wonderful.  The greens and blues against the black of the sky are fantastic!', '2008-06-04 13:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748661, 685479, 90658, '<td valign="top">What is the straight line going from the base of the tree to the top of the shot?  Is it a satellite trail?  It is sort of distracting.</td>', 'What is the straight line going from the base of the tree to the top of the shot?  Is it a satellite trail?  It is sort of distracting.', '2008-06-04 13:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748663, 685384, 90658, '<td valign="top">Seems really out of focus.  Also, there isn''t a lot of visual depth.</td>', 'Seems really out of focus.  Also, there isn''t a lot of visual depth.', '2008-06-04 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748665, 685475, 93765, '<td valign="top">Nice little cloud there, and the gradient has potential. I''m not too thrilled by the vignetting, the noice and the lens dust smudge (?), though.</td>', 'Nice little cloud there, and the gradient has potential. I''m not too thrilled by the vignetting, the noice and the lens dust smudge (?), though.', '2008-06-04 13:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748667, 685129, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice using a macro on this.  It adds something unique.</td>', 'Interesting choice using a macro on this.  It adds something unique.', '2008-06-04 13:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748696, 685444, 93765, '<td valign="top">Nice one! The trees could be a bit sharper, and I find your frame unduly heavy. Some cropping from the right, perhaps? And how about placing that flash just a bit further to the right...;)</td>', 'Nice one! The trees could be a bit sharper, and I find your frame unduly heavy. Some cropping from the right, perhaps? And how about placing that flash just a bit further to the right...;)', '2008-06-04 13:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748698, 684742, 90658, '<td valign="top">Visually stunning!  I am going to be a real stickler on the DNMC here, forgive me..."Use the moon, stars or planets to create a photo that''s out of this world!"<br/> <br/>I really do like this shot, though.  I''m sure ultimately, you will score pretty well, as it is one of the better shots in this challenge, but I had to knock a few points off.</td>', 'Visually stunning!  I am going to be a real stickler on the DNMC here, forgive me..."Use the moon, stars or planets to create a photo that''s out of this world!" I really do like this shot, though.  I''m sure ultimately, you will score pretty well, as it is one of the better shots in this challenge, but I had to knock a few points off.', '2008-06-04 13:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748718, 684485, 90658, '<td valign="top">Love that you followed the rules and still managed to capture a nicely designed shot.  The reflection adds depth, the clouds add dimension and the grasses add color.</td>', 'Love that you followed the rules and still managed to capture a nicely designed shot.  The reflection adds depth, the clouds add dimension and the grasses add color.', '2008-06-04 13:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748734, 684916, 93765, '<td valign="top">Night sky with a double rainbow might be stretching the task just a bit too far. I can see why you wanted to share it anyway, though. A fantastic moment, no doubt. PP is a matter of taste, of course. For me, something else might have been tastier.</td>', 'Night sky with a double rainbow might be stretching the task just a bit too far. I can see why you wanted to share it anyway, though. A fantastic moment, no doubt. PP is a matter of taste, of course. For me, something else might have been tastier.', '2008-06-04 13:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748800, 685090, 90658, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I just find it to be lacking in wow power.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I just find it to be lacking in wow power.', '2008-06-04 14:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748803, 685345, 93765, '<td valign="top">Well, you got a good laugh from me! Good thing I wasn''t eating. Pure genius. Focus, composition, colours - spot on;) You just have to hope that people don''t have dirty screens (mine is a borderline case). A 10 for creativity (and to balance the poor sods who don''t get it...).</td>', 'Well, you got a good laugh from me! Good thing I wasn''t eating. Pure genius. Focus, composition, colours - spot on;) You just have to hope that people don''t have dirty screens (mine is a borderline case). A 10 for creativity (and to balance the poor sods who don''t get it...).', '2008-06-04 14:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748806, 684916, 90658, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot!  Just not quiet to challenge...no stars, moon or planets.<br/> <br/>Love the shot though.  The effects are wonderful.</td>', 'Stunning shot!  Just not quiet to challenge...no stars, moon or planets. Love the shot though.  The effects are wonderful.', '2008-06-04 14:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748811, 683701, 93765, '<td valign="top">Add a "Line" to the challenge title, and you are in the box. But what''s in a word, right?</td>', 'Add a "Line" to the challenge title, and you are in the box. But what''s in a word, right?', '2008-06-04 14:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748820, 683137, 90658, '<td valign="top">This could have been spectacular.  The squiggle light play detracts my eye from everything that is great...the oldness of the wooden coppola, the mountain, the sand, the color of the sand.  I''m sure a lot of people are going to love it, but for me I would rather see just the landscape.</td>', 'This could have been spectacular.  The squiggle light play detracts my eye from everything that is great...the oldness of the wooden coppola, the mountain, the sand, the color of the sand.  I''m sure a lot of people are going to love it, but for me I would rather see just the landscape.', '2008-06-04 14:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748824, 683256, 90658, '<td valign="top">With a glossy print page, this could grace the cover of a magazine.</td>', 'With a glossy print page, this could grace the cover of a magazine.', '2008-06-04 14:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748826, 685384, 93765, '<td valign="top">Brave. I find this somewhat lacking in the technical and artistic departments. Almost a full set of grays, though;)</td>', 'Brave. I find this somewhat lacking in the technical and artistic departments. Almost a full set of grays, though;)', '2008-06-04 14:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748828, 684408, 90658, '<td valign="top">FANTASTIC!!!!<br/> <br/>I''ve had trouble seeing the Eagle Nebula in other shots, but in this one it is reight there, obvious and glorious.<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'FANTASTIC!!!! I''ve had trouble seeing the Eagle Nebula in other shots, but in this one it is reight there, obvious and glorious. Well done!', '2008-06-04 14:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748832, 685271, 90658, '<td valign="top">Elegant!  Soft and mysterious.  Thank you.</td>', 'Elegant!  Soft and mysterious.  Thank you.', '2008-06-04 14:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748838, 683953, 93765, '<td valign="top">You did the best out of it, though. I like it!</td>', 'You did the best out of it, though. I like it!', '2008-06-04 14:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748843, 685125, 90658, '<td valign="top">You know, I absolutely love this shot!  I am adding to my favorites.<br/> <br/>But here is the heartbreak, I generally don''t DNMC folks because I can usually find some way to fit every shot into a challenge.  But this one was very specific about what was required...stars, moon &amp; planets.<br/> <br/>This is a wonderful shot, but I''m going to have to dock a point or two.</td>', 'You know, I absolutely love this shot!  I am adding to my favorites. But here is the heartbreak, I generally don''t DNMC folks because I can usually find some way to fit every shot into a challenge.  But this one was very specific about what was required...stars, moon & planets. This is a wonderful shot, but I''m going to have to dock a point or two.', '2008-06-04 14:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748846, 684061, 90658, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  Thank you for this look at the wonder of nature.</td>', 'Stunning!  Thank you for this look at the wonder of nature.', '2008-06-04 14:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748870, 683953, 69368, '<td valign="top">like the colors and the title very much</td>', 'like the colors and the title very much', '2008-06-04 14:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748885, 685351, 69368, '<td valign="top">beautiful! very peaceful scenery</td>', 'beautiful! very peaceful scenery', '2008-06-04 14:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748891, 684916, 69368, '<td valign="top">hm... a rainbow in the night? I have to think about this</td>', 'hm... a rainbow in the night? I have to think about this', '2008-06-04 14:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748894, 685422, 69368, '<td valign="top">one of the best in challenge! Good luck!</td>', 'one of the best in challenge! Good luck!', '2008-06-04 14:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748895, 685125, 69368, '<td valign="top">wow! you captured a very dramatic moment. like also the color of sky</td>', 'wow! you captured a very dramatic moment. like also the color of sky', '2008-06-04 14:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748900, 685129, 14369, '<td valign="top">Looks messy????</td>', 'Looks messy????', '2008-06-04 14:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748908, 683105, 14369, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - 9</td>', 'Beautiful - 9', '2008-06-04 14:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748911, 685447, 93765, '<td valign="top">Nice. That smudge to the right, something that happened in PP? I assume it is the noice reduction, that screwed up the star trails further from the north star? Perhaps you could have darkened it all, to bring out the stars better, and tone down the ground. Lifting the angle to clear the trees would have been beneficial and given you more stars (but you probably didn''t even see them in the dark).</td>', 'Nice. That smudge to the right, something that happened in PP? I assume it is the noice reduction, that screwed up the star trails further from the north star? Perhaps you could have darkened it all, to bring out the stars better, and tone down the ground. Lifting the angle to clear the trees would have been beneficial and given you more stars (but you probably didn''t even see them in the dark).', '2008-06-04 14:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748914, 683603, 14369, '<td valign="top">very sharp~! Would be a nice print.. 10</td>', 'very sharp~! Would be a nice print.. 10', '2008-06-04 14:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748918, 685461, 88038, '<td valign="top">Good long capture.</td>', 'Good long capture.', '2008-06-04 14:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748920, 685271, 14369, '<td valign="top">too bright for me - 5</td>', 'too bright for me - 5', '2008-06-04 14:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748924, 684485, 88038, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2008-06-04 14:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748929, 685459, 88038, '<td valign="top">What are the Orange stripes?</td>', 'What are the Orange stripes?', '2008-06-04 14:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748932, 683256, 93765, '<td valign="top">Great shot, just the sort of stuff I hoped to see in here!</td>', 'Great shot, just the sort of stuff I hoped to see in here!', '2008-06-04 14:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748933, 685125, 88038, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2008-06-04 14:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748934, 685447, 88038, '<td valign="top">A Clasic</td>', 'A Clasic', '2008-06-04 14:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748935, 684785, 88038, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2008-06-04 14:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748940, 685476, 88038, '<td valign="top">Creative</td>', 'Creative', '2008-06-04 14:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748942, 685155, 88038, '<td valign="top">I always enjoy long exp</td>', 'I always enjoy long exp', '2008-06-04 14:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748944, 684785, 93765, '<td valign="top">Very nice. "Stairways to heaven" came to mind. The white frame is a bit overpowering, though.</td>', 'Very nice. "Stairways to heaven" came to mind. The white frame is a bit overpowering, though.', '2008-06-04 14:33:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4748952, 683783, 93765, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the lucky moment! Great shot!</td>', 'Congratulations on the lucky moment! Great shot!', '2008-06-04 14:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748955, 683783, 88038, '<td valign="top">Now that''s something you don''t see every day.</td>', 'Now that''s something you don''t see every day.', '2008-06-04 14:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748962, 684742, 88038, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2008-06-04 14:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748964, 685384, 88038, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast.</td>', 'I like the contrast.', '2008-06-04 14:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748968, 685125, 93765, '<td valign="top">Ooh, perfect! The best flash picture I can remember having seen (not that I can remember too many...;)</td>', 'Ooh, perfect! The best flash picture I can remember having seen (not that I can remember too many...;)', '2008-06-04 14:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748973, 684798, 93765, '<td valign="top">Very nice, no, perfect fits it better. Really great, all aspects of it!</td>', 'Very nice, no, perfect fits it better. Really great, all aspects of it!', '2008-06-04 14:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4748987, 683137, 93765, '<td valign="top">You got me googleing the title (in the - vain - hope of some deep significance). A nice way of adding some interest to what could otherwise have been a fairly drab picture.</td>', 'You got me googleing the title (in the - vain - hope of some deep significance). A nice way of adding some interest to what could otherwise have been a fairly drab picture.', '2008-06-04 14:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749008, 684742, 93765, '<td valign="top">So that''s what it looks like from up close, thanks for showing. What''s that ray or line at 10:30 symbolizing? Cool effect in the floodlights. Interesting picture, though perhaps just marginally off topic.</td>', 'So that''s what it looks like from up close, thanks for showing. What''s that ray or line at 10:30 symbolizing? Cool effect in the floodlights. Interesting picture, though perhaps just marginally off topic.', '2008-06-04 14:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749024, 683965, 93765, '<td valign="top">Right place at the right time? Congratulations to a spectacular shot!</td>', 'Right place at the right time? Congratulations to a spectacular shot!', '2008-06-04 15:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749041, 685479, 93765, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot already as such, but the plane trail makes it special. Maybe you could have cloned out the hotspots, they do disturb (but I am envious that you have so few, compared to what I end up with...).</td>', 'Very nice shot already as such, but the plane trail makes it special. Maybe you could have cloned out the hotspots, they do disturb (but I am envious that you have so few, compared to what I end up with...).', '2008-06-04 15:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749055, 684916, 43088, '<td valign="top">A nice shot. Part seems too dark, part too light. I was also unaware that you could see rainbows in a night sky.</td>', 'A nice shot. Part seems too dark, part too light. I was also unaware that you could see rainbows in a night sky.', '2008-06-04 15:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749058, 683256, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice lens.</td>', 'Nice lens.', '2008-06-04 15:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749062, 685400, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Difficult exposure as far as trying to see more in the buildings. Could you lighten your shadows more with your editing program?</td>', 'Nice colors.  Difficult exposure as far as trying to see more in the buildings. Could you lighten your shadows more with your editing program?', '2008-06-04 15:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
