(4749635, 683603, 62187, '<td valign="top">The photo is excellent. However, I feel that most of it''s excellence is more focused on the buildings rather then the ''Night Sky''. But, I know how that goes as I live in the brightest city in the world and the night sky has all but disappeared. I should give the photo a 9 even though it''s really a 9.5. Since there is no 9.5 I''ll just round it up to 10. Ok?</td>', 'The photo is excellent. However, I feel that most of it''s excellence is more focused on the buildings rather then the ''Night Sky''. But, I know how that goes as I live in the brightest city in the world and the night sky has all but disappeared. I should give the photo a 9 even though it''s really a 9.5. Since there is no 9.5 I''ll just round it up to 10. Ok?', '2008-06-04 19:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749651, 685155, 62187, '<td valign="top">I start all my scores off at 10 and look for things that make it not be a 10. To me, it looks like you''ve tried to sharpen a photo that was not quite in perfect focus. ( I know, it''s star trails and they sometimes have that look.) It looks over-sharpened to me but still a very lovely photo. 8</td>', 'I start all my scores off at 10 and look for things that make it not be a 10. To me, it looks like you''ve tried to sharpen a photo that was not quite in perfect focus. ( I know, it''s star trails and they sometimes have that look.) It looks over-sharpened to me but still a very lovely photo. 8', '2008-06-04 19:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749655, 685354, 62187, '<td valign="top">I looks like you''ve smoothed the heck out of it. I''d think I''d rather have seen a more natural looking photo but I still like yours. It reminds me of a record album. Nice work: 9</td>', 'I looks like you''ve smoothed the heck out of it. I''d think I''d rather have seen a more natural looking photo but I still like yours. It reminds me of a record album. Nice work: 9', '2008-06-04 19:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749663, 684742, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hmmm? I''m not sure what to make of this. First, I really like the photo: it''s totally cool. My only reserves are that I''m not buying it for what I think the challenge was calling for. To me, it looks like there is still a hint of color in the sky and clouds like it''s still dusk or dawn. I''ll still go high despite my confusion: 8</td>', 'Hmmm? I''m not sure what to make of this. First, I really like the photo: it''s totally cool. My only reserves are that I''m not buying it for what I think the challenge was calling for. To me, it looks like there is still a hint of color in the sky and clouds like it''s still dusk or dawn. I''ll still go high despite my confusion: 8', '2008-06-04 19:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749665, 685348, 62187, '<td valign="top">Yes, I can see the time and a very nice job in your photo as well: 9</td>', 'Yes, I can see the time and a very nice job in your photo as well: 9', '2008-06-04 19:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749669, 685129, 62187, '<td valign="top">I must say it is a very nice try.</td>', 'I must say it is a very nice try.', '2008-06-04 19:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749672, 683965, 62187, '<td valign="top">Nice catch! Would be interesting to know if you planned it this way or if it was by chance. Love the little lighting in the trees to the lower left.</td>', 'Nice catch! Would be interesting to know if you planned it this way or if it was by chance. Love the little lighting in the trees to the lower left.', '2008-06-04 19:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749679, 685283, 62187, '<td valign="top">This is Astrophotography. This is the Night Sky. This is a 10.</td>', 'This is Astrophotography. This is the Night Sky. This is a 10.', '2008-06-04 19:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749681, 683105, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very good for an Urban setting. Was hoping for more of natural setting for the challenge. Still, it''s very good and interesting to me: 9</td>', 'Very good for an Urban setting. Was hoping for more of natural setting for the challenge. Still, it''s very good and interesting to me: 9', '2008-06-04 19:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749683, 685397, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the title because it''s not the Milky Way: or, at least it''s not visible in your photo. I do however like your photo: which is what we''re here to judge. 8</td>', 'I don''t like the title because it''s not the Milky Way: or, at least it''s not visible in your photo. I do however like your photo: which is what we''re here to judge. 8', '2008-06-04 19:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749684, 684485, 62187, '<td valign="top">Very good and nice work: 10</td>', 'Very good and nice work: 10', '2008-06-04 19:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749700, 684419, 62187, '<td valign="top">There are more interesting parts of the sky for sure. What you''ve captured is the handle of the Big Dipper. Or more correctly: the Tail of the Bear: Ursa Major. The named stars are left to right: Phecda (on the very edge), Megrez, Alioth, Mizar with it''s double Alcor (It splits into a triple through a telescope) and lastly is Alkaid. The two brighter stars on the right-hand side are part of Bootes and the lower ones are part of Draco. So, I''m not sure if your photo title was a statement or a question. But, that''s what''s out there. Oh, and I''ll score your photo a 9.</td>', 'There are more interesting parts of the sky for sure. What you''ve captured is the handle of the Big Dipper. Or more correctly: the Tail of the Bear: Ursa Major. The named stars are left to right: Phecda (on the very edge), Megrez, Alioth, Mizar with it''s double Alcor (It splits into a triple through a telescope) and lastly is Alkaid. The two brighter stars on the right-hand side are part of Bootes and the lower ones are part of Draco. So, I''m not sure if your photo title was a statement or a question. But, that''s what''s out there. Oh, and I''ll score your photo a 9.', '2008-06-04 19:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749702, 685321, 62187, '<td valign="top">If it were a little bit sharper I''d have scored it higher. I''ll go higher then middle of the road for the nice colors: 7</td>', 'If it were a little bit sharper I''d have scored it higher. I''ll go higher then middle of the road for the nice colors: 7', '2008-06-04 19:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749706, 683883, 62187, '<td valign="top">An excellent photo that is not screaming but obviously it''s ''Night'' and the ''Sky'' part is almost nil.</td>', 'An excellent photo that is not screaming but obviously it''s ''Night'' and the ''Sky'' part is almost nil.', '2008-06-04 20:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749707, 685384, 62187, '<td valign="top">What a brave soul. If it were in another challenge I''d have scored it much higher.</td>', 'What a brave soul. If it were in another challenge I''d have scored it much higher.', '2008-06-04 20:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749711, 685447, 62187, '<td valign="top">Excellent! You must have taken this near area with some slight light-pollution. 10</td>', 'Excellent! You must have taken this near area with some slight light-pollution. 10', '2008-06-04 20:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749714, 685310, 62187, '<td valign="top">Someday I want to see one in person - my roots are from there. Thanks for sharing some awesome colors!</td>', 'Someday I want to see one in person - my roots are from there. Thanks for sharing some awesome colors!', '2008-06-04 20:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749717, 683701, 62187, '<td valign="top">A very good photo that is obviously ''Night'' but not much ''Sky'' action going on. I know, I live in the worlds brightest city and why I stayed away from the challenge. Gas is too expensive to drive into the country just for a dpc photo.</td>', 'A very good photo that is obviously ''Night'' but not much ''Sky'' action going on. I know, I live in the worlds brightest city and why I stayed away from the challenge. Gas is too expensive to drive into the country just for a dpc photo.', '2008-06-04 20:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
