(4749734, 685034, 62187, '<td valign="top">In some ways I really like it. It''s kind of creepy with an ironic foreground of flowers. The flowers are over-sharpened or compressed and the flash is very harsh. I like the rest of it though. I fear it will score on the lower end of the stack but thanks for sharing something different and for staying outside the box.</td>', 'In some ways I really like it. It''s kind of creepy with an ironic foreground of flowers. The flowers are over-sharpened or compressed and the flash is very harsh. I like the rest of it though. I fear it will score on the lower end of the stack but thanks for sharing something different and for staying outside the box.', '2008-06-04 20:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749739, 685479, 62187, '<td valign="top">I think ''Night Flight'' would have been a possibly better title. But we''re not here to vote on titles and yours is fine. It''s too bad for size constraints. Having to shrink these star-trail photos I think has reduced the true beauty of them. It looks over-sharpened but I understand. I''ll go with an 8</td>', 'I think ''Night Flight'' would have been a possibly better title. But we''re not here to vote on titles and yours is fine. It''s too bad for size constraints. Having to shrink these star-trail photos I think has reduced the true beauty of them. It looks over-sharpened but I understand. I''ll go with an 8', '2008-06-04 20:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749742, 683159, 62187, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just me: I''m not seeing the night. Other then that, it looks like lovely photo of a lovely place.</td>', 'Maybe it''s just me: I''m not seeing the night. Other then that, it looks like lovely photo of a lovely place.', '2008-06-04 20:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
