(4749767, 685351, 62187, '<td valign="top">This has got to be the luckiest catch in the world! I''m jealous of your Southern Skies and hope to see them in person someday. It would have been nice to see the Large Magellanic Cloud or Omega Centauri but I will certainly take this Magical photo! It''s nothing less then 10. Great work!</td>', 'This has got to be the luckiest catch in the world! I''m jealous of your Southern Skies and hope to see them in person someday. It would have been nice to see the Large Magellanic Cloud or Omega Centauri but I will certainly take this Magical photo! It''s nothing less then 10. Great work!', '2008-06-04 20:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4749772, 685459, 62187, '<td valign="top">I would have given it a 10 except FOR the lasers. Interesting for sure but it for me, I think a better crop of just the Milky Way would have blown all the others out of the water. As it stands, I''ll go with an 8.</td>', 'I would have given it a 10 except FOR the lasers. Interesting for sure but it for me, I think a better crop of just the Milky Way would have blown all the others out of the water. As it stands, I''ll go with an 8.', '2008-06-04 20:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
