(4749841, 685271, 62187, '<td valign="top">All I can think of is ''...like a big pizza pie...'' but it''s not Amore to me. It looks like a real night shot because of the lighting of the houses: porch lights. And, I can see a couple of stars in the sky. But, the ''Moon'' is freaking me out. It looks more like the Sun. During the voting submission days, the Moon was nowhere near to being full. If it were the moon during that submission day phase, I don''t think it would look that round no matter how long of an exposure. If it were the Sun (and you severely photo-shopped the photo), I know no stars would be visible. So, I don''t think the photo was taken during the submission dates but I can''t be certain. So, I like the photo, it''s really cool looking and that''s what it''s all about. Unless the ''Hokey Pokey'' IS what it''s really all about. I''ll shut up and go with an 8.</td>', 'All I can think of is ''...like a big pizza pie...'' but it''s not Amore to me. It looks like a real night shot because of the lighting of the houses: porch lights. And, I can see a couple of stars in the sky. But, the ''Moon'' is freaking me out. It looks more like the Sun. During the voting submission days, the Moon was nowhere near to being full. If it were the moon during that submission day phase, I don''t think it would look that round no matter how long of an exposure. If it were the Sun (and you severely photo-shopped the photo), I know no stars would be visible. So, I don''t think the photo was taken during the submission dates but I can''t be certain. So, I like the photo, it''s really cool looking and that''s what it''s all about. Unless the ''Hokey Pokey'' IS what it''s really all about. I''ll shut up and go with an 8.', '2008-06-04 21:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
