(4750147, 685348, 44877, '<td valign="top">Whee! Love the composition and the overall effect. Not too fond of the color, as it were. The tone, perhaps. Kind of sepia-ish... Maybe this is a pure BW, I don''t know. Doesn''t look like it, though. However, the crispness is great.</td>', 'Whee! Love the composition and the overall effect. Not too fond of the color, as it were. The tone, perhaps. Kind of sepia-ish... Maybe this is a pure BW, I don''t know. Doesn''t look like it, though. However, the crispness is great.', '2008-06-04 22:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750151, 683603, 44877, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, thrilling - the bright white against the deep blue/black. The shining lights and the reflections - very good. A bit of a skew would have been helpful - in my opinion - so that the buildings are not all leaning towards the middle.</td>', 'Beautiful, thrilling - the bright white against the deep blue/black. The shining lights and the reflections - very good. A bit of a skew would have been helpful - in my opinion - so that the buildings are not all leaning towards the middle.', '2008-06-04 22:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750155, 685345, 44877, '<td valign="top">Had to look for a minute - great minimalism and composition. The blue frame is a bit redundant, in my opinion, but hey - love the image, nonetheless.</td>', 'Had to look for a minute - great minimalism and composition. The blue frame is a bit redundant, in my opinion, but hey - love the image, nonetheless.', '2008-06-04 22:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750158, 683783, 44877, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. The light by the buildings make this even more interesting.</td>', 'Nice catch. The light by the buildings make this even more interesting.', '2008-06-04 22:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750162, 685400, 44877, '<td valign="top">This seems more like a dawn or dusk shot - even so, very pretty. Lovely composition and colors.</td>', 'This seems more like a dawn or dusk shot - even so, very pretty. Lovely composition and colors.', '2008-06-04 22:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750164, 683883, 44877, '<td valign="top">Yes! The way the sky turns yellow before a storm - well captured. And all the happy lights... it makes you wonder what will happen. Great reflections.</td>', 'Yes! The way the sky turns yellow before a storm - well captured. And all the happy lights... it makes you wonder what will happen. Great reflections.', '2008-06-04 22:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750165, 684742, 44877, '<td valign="top">Lights, POV, reflections are all great. The powerline - or whatever it is - could have been cloned out, but that''s minor.</td>', 'Lights, POV, reflections are all great. The powerline - or whatever it is - could have been cloned out, but that''s minor.', '2008-06-04 22:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
