(4751798, 684626, 90658, '<td valign="top">The purple coloring is something totally different.  It catches my eye.<br/> <br/>The focus seems off, or maybe that is cloud cover...</td>', 'The purple coloring is something totally different.  It catches my eye. The focus seems off, or maybe that is cloud cover...', '2008-06-05 14:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
