(4751815, 685155, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is interesting.  I can''t tell if it is oof or not...see the bridge line.<br/> <br/>The bridge isn''t moving and yet there seems to be a hint of motion there. <br/> <br/>For me, the red lights are what I see first, but as they are part of the structure, not much you could do about them.</td>', 'This is interesting.  I can''t tell if it is oof or not...see the bridge line. The bridge isn''t moving and yet there seems to be a hint of motion there.  For me, the red lights are what I see first, but as they are part of the structure, not much you could do about them.', '2008-06-05 14:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4751817, 684371, 90658, '<td valign="top">I just don''t know what I''m looking at here.  It is also an extremely harsh color contrast to my eye.</td>', 'I just don''t know what I''m looking at here.  It is also an extremely harsh color contrast to my eye.', '2008-06-05 14:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
