(4751845, 685461, 90658, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!</td>', 'Very nicely done!', '2008-06-05 14:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4751846, 685283, 90658, '<td valign="top">Nice job here.  I feel as if all the stars, and myself, are moving towards the cluster.</td>', 'Nice job here.  I feel as if all the stars, and myself, are moving towards the cluster.', '2008-06-05 14:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4751848, 685354, 90658, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better time lapse in the bunch.</td>', 'This is one of the better time lapse in the bunch.', '2008-06-05 14:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4751853, 683883, 90658, '<td valign="top">Here''s my problem...<br/> <br/>I generally don''t get all crazy about challenge descriptions, but this one was so specific in what was wanted: moon, stars, planets, that I feel like I can''t ignore it.<br/> <br/>Then, I come to a shot like this; magnificent, stunning, simply one of the best in the group, but no moon, stars, planets.<br/> <br/>What do I do?  Acknowledge the greatness of the shot, and then feel all sad and let down because imo it is DNMC.  That is a shame for me and for you.  But what I had to do, sorry.</td>', 'Here''s my problem... I generally don''t get all crazy about challenge descriptions, but this one was so specific in what was wanted: moon, stars, planets, that I feel like I can''t ignore it. Then, I come to a shot like this; magnificent, stunning, simply one of the best in the group, but no moon, stars, planets. What do I do?  Acknowledge the greatness of the shot, and then feel all sad and let down because imo it is DNMC.  That is a shame for me and for you.  But what I had to do, sorry.', '2008-06-05 14:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4751854, 685314, 90658, '<td valign="top">I wish this were crisper and had more contrast.</td>', 'I wish this were crisper and had more contrast.', '2008-06-05 14:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4751855, 683783, 90658, '<td valign="top">More crisp.  Also, is the house exploding because of the lightning?  That flash of light almost overpowers the ligtening.</td>', 'More crisp.  Also, is the house exploding because of the lightning?  That flash of light almost overpowers the ligtening.', '2008-06-05 14:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
