(4759710, 684485, 88054, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like daytime except for the stars. I like how you were able to keep a sharp focus even with the long exposure. Only a touch of blur in the lower right. The clouds and stars look really good. Love the stillness. Beautiful place. Good luck.</td>', 'This almost looks like daytime except for the stars. I like how you were able to keep a sharp focus even with the long exposure. Only a touch of blur in the lower right. The clouds and stars look really good. Love the stillness. Beautiful place. Good luck.', '2008-06-09 14:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
