(4759731, 685271, 88054, '<td valign="top">The moon is a little too bright for me. This is a very difficult shot due to the extream darkness and light. This becomes a compromise between blowing out the whites or underexposing the darks. I personally prefer a slight under exposure of the moon so it is not so overwhelming. Of course the land and trees will be darker. Again just a personal preference. Good luck.</td>', 'The moon is a little too bright for me. This is a very difficult shot due to the extream darkness and light. This becomes a compromise between blowing out the whites or underexposing the darks. I personally prefer a slight under exposure of the moon so it is not so overwhelming. Of course the land and trees will be darker. Again just a personal preference. Good luck.', '2008-06-09 15:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
