(4760061, 685475, 28054, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve got one or two comments already but I had to score this low because I can''t tell what it is. Focus is way off, composition is off balance, theres way too much noise in the photo. In future, try isolating your subject and if your incorporating additional items into the shot (such as the fluff in the bottom right corner) make sure they add something to the picture. Good luck.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve got one or two comments already but I had to score this low because I can''t tell what it is. Focus is way off, composition is off balance, theres way too much noise in the photo. In future, try isolating your subject and if your incorporating additional items into the shot (such as the fluff in the bottom right corner) make sure they add something to the picture. Good luck.', '2008-06-09 18:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
