(4761634, 683603, 77192, '<td valign="top">Not sure I care for the border or the lens distortion but, other than that, this is the best of the bunch :-) great work!<br/> <br/>Something like this should work really well in the high contrast challenge :-)</td>', 'Not sure I care for the border or the lens distortion but, other than that, this is the best of the bunch :-) great work! Something like this should work really well in the high contrast challenge :-)', '2008-06-10 15:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
