(4762738, 684061, 53964, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking!  <br/>The dedication to getting the perfect shot is humbling... I grumble if a setup/shoot takes more than half an hour :)<br/> <br/>It''s a shame that most of us don''t realise just how much goes into astrophotography.</td>', 'Breathtaking!  The dedication to getting the perfect shot is humbling... I grumble if a setup/shoot takes more than half an hour :) It''s a shame that most of us don''t realise just how much goes into astrophotography.', '2008-06-11 01:10:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762739, 685354, 90651, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of your kind comments, I only wish they were for a legitimate entry! Basically, I was pissed at the weather that I couldn''t do this challenge and decided to show off what I <u><i><b>could</b></i></u> have done.  I hope you can understand my frustration and try to forgive me.<br/> <br/>Replies:<br/>Bvy: no city lights anywhere near, I don''t know where it came from.<br/>Zoomdak: 9743 second exposure! 2 1/2 hours or so?<br/>Kali: Nope, Canon 10D on Sigma 12-24. Thanks for the award, I feel honored, unfortunately, you should give it to someone else. Sorry.<br/>Metatate: Wow! A 10! Plus an Envy! I''m humbled but again, you should give it to someone who didn''t cheat. :(<br/>Blackbox: no smoothing done, just some color shifts and lots of dust removal<br/>AP: Hey! I know you! Do you remember me?</td>', 'Thanks for all of your kind comments, I only wish they were for a legitimate entry! Basically, I was pissed at the weather that I couldn''t do this challenge and decided to show off what I could have done.  I hope you can understand my frustration and try to forgive me. Replies:Bvy: no city lights anywhere near, I don''t know where it came from.Zoomdak: 9743 second exposure! 2 1/2 hours or so?Kali: Nope, Canon 10D on Sigma 12-24. Thanks for the award, I feel honored, unfortunately, you should give it to someone else. Sorry.Metatate: Wow! A 10! Plus an Envy! I''m humbled but again, you should give it to someone who didn''t cheat. :(Blackbox: no smoothing done, just some color shifts and lots of dust removalAP: Hey! I know you! Do you remember me?', '2008-06-11 01:10:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762745, 684408, 40718, '<td valign="top">I feel your pain with the 4th with such an awesome score.  This now ranks in the Top 10 photos all time to not ribbon...</td>', 'I feel your pain with the 4th with such an awesome score.  This now ranks in the Top 10 photos all time to not ribbon...', '2008-06-11 01:10:42.000000', NULL, 0),
