(4762779, 684061, 63503, '<td valign="top">I''ve been an admirer of your images ever since I saw them for the first time. Your tutorials on astrophotography are exceptional. I am glad you thought of combining earthly objects with the sky, I suspect that made the difference as far a dpc voters. This is an outastanding image and a long overdue ribbon. Congratulations John !!</td>', 'I''ve been an admirer of your images ever since I saw them for the first time. Your tutorials on astrophotography are exceptional. I am glad you thought of combining earthly objects with the sky, I suspect that made the difference as far a dpc voters. This is an outastanding image and a long overdue ribbon. Congratulations John !!', '2008-06-11 01:18:57.000000', NULL, 0),
