(4762929, 685125, 69046, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 10''s, on a totally selfish note, I''m impressed I finally picked a winner. Praise through appreciation. Your score is incredible, it restores my faith in Colorado :}<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-11 00:51:08.</i></td>', 'I was one of your 10''s, on a totally selfish note, I''m impressed I finally picked a winner. Praise through appreciation. Your score is incredible, it restores my faith in Colorado :}', '2008-06-11 01:50:29.000000', '2008-06-11 01:51:08.000000', 0),
(4762947, 684408, 90663, '<td valign="top">Well, you sure had many of us fooled as to whose image this was!<br/> <br/>Astrophotography of deep space is so demanding, polar alignment has to be spot on, super long exposures, usually multiple exposures, fussy focus issues...this is a superb effort and as I''m sure others will say, was fully deserving of front page status.</td>', 'Well, you sure had many of us fooled as to whose image this was! Astrophotography of deep space is so demanding, polar alignment has to be spot on, super long exposures, usually multiple exposures, fussy focus issues...this is a superb effort and as I''m sure others will say, was fully deserving of front page status.', '2008-06-11 02:01:46.000000', NULL, 0),
