(4763004, 685479, 15643, '<td valign="top">I know nobody reads 12th place after a challenge, but i will tell my story anyways. I found out about this challenge the day it was due! And of course it is summer in the northern hemisphere and of course i am on the west side of the US! The sun does not set untill 8:30PM and the challenge was due at 9:00! Stars didnt come out untill 8:50!! ugh so i only got one shot at it, and someone walked by with their flashlight! anyways, look out for my retry in free study with the star shot.</td>', 'I know nobody reads 12th place after a challenge, but i will tell my story anyways. I found out about this challenge the day it was due! And of course it is summer in the northern hemisphere and of course i am on the west side of the US! The sun does not set untill 8:30PM and the challenge was due at 9:00! Stars didnt come out untill 8:50!! ugh so i only got one shot at it, and someone walked by with their flashlight! anyways, look out for my retry in free study with the star shot.', '2008-06-11 02:27:44.000000', NULL, 0),
