(4763309, 684408, 84124, '<td valign="top">This is simply an amazing image, not to take anything away from the top three (of which I''m one) but this deserved to ribbon.  I''ve shot this DSO repeatedly over the years, and due to it''s low declination in the southern sky, I have failed repeatedly.  Great shot, easily one of the best.</td>', 'This is simply an amazing image, not to take anything away from the top three (of which I''m one) but this deserved to ribbon.  I''ve shot this DSO repeatedly over the years, and due to it''s low declination in the southern sky, I have failed repeatedly.  Great shot, easily one of the best.', '2008-06-11 07:48:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4763322, 683603, 45631, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.</td>', 'This is beautiful.', '2008-06-11 08:03:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4763390, 683603, 33145, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot of my new "home town". Great inspiration for me - I really need to get across the other side of the Yarra one night and try that angle!</td>', 'Stunning shot of my new "home town". Great inspiration for me - I really need to get across the other side of the Yarra one night and try that angle!', '2008-06-11 08:35:01.000000', NULL, 0),
