(4763412, 684061, 27812, '<td valign="top">In truth..... the only reason this is not a blue ribbon is the fact that true photgraphy on DPC made way for eyecandy. Fantastic effort and pic.</td>', 'In truth..... the only reason this is not a blue ribbon is the fact that true photgraphy on DPC made way for eyecandy. Fantastic effort and pic.', '2008-06-11 08:46:39.000000', NULL, 0),
