(4764110, 684408, 9462, '<td valign="top">Hi Primoz, my first choice for red has since been (not officially) DQ''d so if it''s any consolation my 2nd choice was your image. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=670651" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670651.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670651.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/9462/120/670651.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Hi Primoz, my first choice for red has since been (not officially) DQ''d so if it''s any consolation my 2nd choice was your image. ', '2008-06-11 14:08:53.000000', NULL, 0),
