(4764971, 683603, 74979, '<td valign="top">one of my favs of the challenge (what can I say I''m a sucker for city skylines:) and a <i>very</i> beautiful &amp; worthy recipient of a ribbon!  good for you Enzo!!<br/> <br/>ETA:  and not a <i>WHINE waa waa</i> in sight hehehe!  YAY!!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-11 20:52:24.</i></td>', 'one of my favs of the challenge (what can I say I''m a sucker for city skylines:) and a very beautiful & worthy recipient of a ribbon!  good for you Enzo!! ETA:  and not a WHINE waa waa in sight hehehe!  YAY!!!', '2008-06-11 21:50:54.000000', '2008-06-11 21:52:24.000000', 0),
(4764976, 684408, 74979, '<td valign="top">amazing image...tough challenge but I have never seen anything like this!  Gorgeous gorgeous and where the heck is Slovinia?  :)<br/> <br/>seriously, come back and play more often!  This is great stuff!</td>', 'amazing image...tough challenge but I have never seen anything like this!  Gorgeous gorgeous and where the heck is Slovinia?  :) seriously, come back and play more often!  This is great stuff!', '2008-06-11 21:56:43.000000', NULL, 0),
