(4764989, 685479, 74979, '<td valign="top">aha!  a flashlight!  I couldnt for the life of me figure out what the heck that dotted trail lighting was..nice how it lined up with tree''s trunk!  Good for you and in such a hurry!<br/> <br/>Nice!</td>', 'aha!  a flashlight!  I couldnt for the life of me figure out what the heck that dotted trail lighting was..nice how it lined up with tree''s trunk!  Good for you and in such a hurry! Nice!', '2008-06-11 22:12:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4764993, 684742, 74979, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10 thought it was fabulous-still do!  Nicely done, gorgeous image, so well composed, exposed, processed, the works!  <i>almost</i> makes me wanna go to Missouri :)</td>', 'I gave this a 10 thought it was fabulous-still do!  Nicely done, gorgeous image, so well composed, exposed, processed, the works!  almost makes me wanna go to Missouri :)', '2008-06-11 22:14:30.000000', NULL, 0),
