(4768035, 685125, 54446, '<td valign="top">So, what happened to your original image file?  I gave this a "5", because it''s very good, but it totally ignored the challenge description requirements.  No, the Earth is the Earth... not a part of the sky.  And, I see no stars or moon.  The challenge was supposed to be about showing the night sky... with stars, planets or moon.  It''s a mystery to me as to why you gathered in so many "10" votes without meeting the requirements of the challenge.  A mystery indeed!  If I had done this, I would have received 93 "1" votes!!!!   LOL!!!   I live in Colorado.  I am sure there were big T-storms somewhere in Colorado on June 2, 2008.  It''s a mystery as to why you were not be able to supply an original image file.  Care to help us understand and be sympathetic?</td>', 'So, what happened to your original image file?  I gave this a "5", because it''s very good, but it totally ignored the challenge description requirements.  No, the Earth is the Earth... not a part of the sky.  And, I see no stars or moon.  The challenge was supposed to be about showing the night sky... with stars, planets or moon.  It''s a mystery to me as to why you gathered in so many "10" votes without meeting the requirements of the challenge.  A mystery indeed!  If I had done this, I would have received 93 "1" votes!!!!   LOL!!!   I live in Colorado.  I am sure there were big T-storms somewhere in Colorado on June 2, 2008.  It''s a mystery as to why you were not be able to supply an original image file.  Care to help us understand and be sympathetic?', '2008-06-13 21:34:28.000000', NULL, 0),
