(4768220, 685354, 90651, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jdannels:</b></div><hr/><i>This is caused from the sensor heating up from being on for so long, it creates little hot spots. It happens with really long exposures. Hope this helps.<br/>Joe </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Mystery solved! Thanks Joe!</td>', 'Originally posted by jdannels:This is caused from the sensor heating up from being on for so long, it creates little hot spots. It happens with really long exposures. Hope this helps.Joe   Mystery solved! Thanks Joe!', '2008-06-14 01:50:04.000000', NULL, 0),
