(4775617, 685461, 56857, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  It looks like I need to recalibrate my monitor.  After uploading this and viewing it on another monitor, much more detail was visible, including more noise as well as my poor job of burning the porch light at the lower left.  This is not a composite - just a bad masking job while using adjustment layers on the sky and foreground.</td>', 'Yikes!  It looks like I need to recalibrate my monitor.  After uploading this and viewing it on another monitor, much more detail was visible, including more noise as well as my poor job of burning the porch light at the lower left.  This is not a composite - just a bad masking job while using adjustment layers on the sky and foreground.', '2008-06-19 00:16:28.000000', NULL, 0),
