(4825834, 685345, 50695, '<td valign="top">I get a strange thrill when I see this image. It''s like when Van Gogh painted those potato peelers. This is what the night sky is *really* like. You are a realist photographer. Who knew that would be a rarity?<br/> <br/>And the night sky is a potent symbol for the Universe, i.e. That Which Is Bigger Than Us. It gives me pause to think about how empty it is.<br/> <br/>But last night I saw a five year old blind girl playing piano so beautifully that the notes appeared to be weeping. So just listen to what music lies in darkness.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-15 09:03:03.</i></td>', 'I get a strange thrill when I see this image. It''s like when Van Gogh painted those potato peelers. This is what the night sky is *really* like. You are a realist photographer. Who knew that would be a rarity? And the night sky is a potent symbol for the Universe, i.e. That Which Is Bigger Than Us. It gives me pause to think about how empty it is. But last night I saw a five year old blind girl playing piano so beautifully that the notes appeared to be weeping. So just listen to what music lies in darkness.', '2008-07-15 10:02:18.000000', '2008-07-15 10:03:03.000000', 0),
(4827966, 684485, 63812, '<td valign="top">Everytime I see this again I think you were rubbed. <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-16 03:12:33.</i></td>', 'Everytime I see this again I think you were rubbed. ', '2008-07-16 03:56:21.000000', '2008-07-16 04:12:33.000000', 0),
(4828885, 683105, 21189, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a skyline! Lovely clouds - pitty there wasn''t more colour in them.</td>', 'That''s quite a skyline! Lovely clouds - pitty there wasn''t more colour in them.', '2008-07-16 13:05:47.000000', NULL, 0),
